{"connection_id": "BC-adf75727e596a9360b80", "ref": "WLC:Jer.32.20", "target": "sec7", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "signs and wonders make a name", "note": "The commentary joins the name as a sign with creation as signs of the Lord; Jeremiah says God performed signs and wonders and made a name for himself, explicitly bringing the two images together."}
